# Tool executions in the OpenTelemetry GenAI conventions, whoever sends them: frameworks' own spans, OpenLLMetry,
# LangSmith, Claude Code's tool span, and MCP client and server spans. OpenLLMetry's LangChain instrumentation for
# JavaScript sends no tool name (`traceloop.entity.name` holds the tool's class): its calls count without one.
a = .attributes
if a."gen_ai.operation.name" == "execute_tool" {
  {
    "name": a."gen_ai.tool.name",
    "error": .status_code == 2 || exists(a."error.type")
  }
} else {
  null
}
